New 3 tier project for docker-compose and k8s

Make sure the files are present as below:

ubuntu@k8s-master:~/three-tier-todo$ ls
README.md  backend  database  docker-compose.yml  frontend  k8s
ubuntu@k8s-master:~/three-tier-todo$ pwd
/home/ubuntu/three-tier-todo

## Command ###
docker-compose up

access UI: http://<public-ip/localhost>:8080
access Backend : http://<public-ip/localhost>:8000/docs
